      "id": "w1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Log registration to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        700,
        -120
      ],
      "notes": "Registrations and failed payments share one Workshops tab so the whole story of an attendee sits in one place in the order it happened; the Event column separates them. This tab IS the attendee list — filter Event = Registered. Every column is mapped explicitly, including ones only one branch fills (Reason is blank on a success), because an unmapped column leaves its cell unwritten and a later append can then land values one column across. Do NOT switch this to 'Map Automatically': left automatic it logs whatever Wati returned instead of the registration."
    },
